=== IMPORTANT SAMPLING NOTE ===
HAProxy configuration checks GET /diary every 1 second from both OCI nodes.
The live HTTP/repository distributions therefore include health-check traffic and are not end-user-only latency distributions.
The repository maximum also includes startup warm-up calls that have no matching HTTP request.
